<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAA may be privatised, listed in 7 yrs-paper.</title>
<headline>SAA may be privatised, listed in 7 yrs-paper.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parastatal South African Airways (SAA) could be fully privatised and listed within seven years, the local Business Day newspaper on Friday quoted the government as saying.</p>
<p>&quot;Government has given details and broad timetables for restructuring the transport industry for the first time, including the possibility that SA Airways could be fully privatised and listed within seven years,&quot; the paper said.</p>
</text>
